==== Cosmetic ====
Parameter for clothes. If the parameter is true, then the item will not render a 3D model (The exception is an item that is worn on the Eye part of the body)
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
Cosmetic = true,
</syntaxhighlight>

{{ll|Category:Item scripts parameters}}